WEBVTT

00:02.290 --> 00:05.950
<b><i>Thank you for using Trans-Earth Lines.</i></b>

00:06.300 --> 00:09.560
<b><i>This flight will depart
from a low earth orbit,</i></b>

00:09.560 --> 00:14.200
<b><i>but atmospheric conditions
may lead to extreme turbulence.</i></b>

00:10.550 --> 00:14.200
<b>Orbital Permet Lift Relay Station</b>

00:14.200 --> 00:17.250
<b><i>In such an event, please follow
the instructions of the crew</i></b>

00:17.250 --> 00:19.080
<b><i>and remain calm.</i></b>

00:20.060 --> 00:23.380
<b><i>Traffic control reports no
dangerous orbital debris.</i></b>

00:23.380 --> 00:28.180
<b><i>If all goes well, we expect to touch down
in 2 hours and 20 minutes.</i></b>

00:28.180 --> 00:30.960
<b>We're so close to Earth...</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:33.350
<b>You've always wanted to go there, right?</b>

00:33.350 --> 00:34.850
<b>Aren't you happy?</b>

00:34.850 --> 00:37.060
<b>Now's not the time to enjoy it.</b>

00:37.060 --> 00:40.560
<b>Well, I hate being on Earth.</b>

00:40.560 --> 00:42.440
<b>I'm a big guy, right?</b>

00:42.440 --> 00:44.780
<b>Earth's gravity is just so...</b>

00:44.780 --> 00:46.440
<b>uncomfortable.</b>

00:46.920 --> 00:50.150
<b>Now then, one more time before we land...</b>

00:51.760 --> 00:53.490
<b>I don't know about that guy.</b>

00:53.490 --> 00:57.120
<b>Don't you hate being
back on Earth even more?</b>

00:57.120 --> 01:00.910
<b>I just want to check out
the situation there once again.</b>

01:01.370 --> 01:02.790
<b>With my own eyes.</b>

01:02.790 --> 01:04.800
<b>Are you really the same Guel Jeturk?</b>

01:04.800 --> 01:07.940
<b>Plus, I can't trust you
to handle the negotiations alone.</b>

01:07.940 --> 01:09.300
<b>Excuse me?!</b>

01:09.300 --> 01:10.420
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

01:11.400 --> 01:13.810
<b><i>I've sent the coordinates.</i></b>

01:13.810 --> 01:15.800
<b><i>I've already verified it, too.</i></b>

01:15.800 --> 01:18.440
<b>I'm grateful you have so many friends.</b>

01:18.440 --> 01:22.470
<b><i>Meanwhile, the Assembly League
may have sniffed us out.</i></b>

01:23.370 --> 01:24.860
<b>The wait is over.</b>

01:24.860 --> 01:26.480
<b>Please proceed with preparations.</b>

01:27.460 --> 01:28.960
<b><i>Yes, ma'am.</i></b>

03:02.140 --> 03:03.620
<b>Still no luck?</b>

03:03.620 --> 03:05.880
<b>She says she has no appetite.</b>

03:05.880 --> 03:09.230
<b>Didn't she make up with Miorine?</b>

03:09.230 --> 03:14.080
<b>She skipped all her classes, too.
Looks like they're through.</b>

03:14.080 --> 03:16.850
<b>Why'd it turn out like this, damn it?!</b>

03:17.560 --> 03:19.260
<b>The stables haven't been cleaned.</b>

03:19.820 --> 03:21.010
<b>Where's Martin?</b>

03:21.660 --> 03:24.390
<b>Do it evenly, or I'll rat you out.</b>

03:24.390 --> 03:26.080
<b>I have nothing to hide.</b>

03:26.080 --> 03:28.440
<b>But the girl you turned in...</b>

03:28.440 --> 03:29.990
<b>What was her name?</b>

03:29.990 --> 03:32.940
<b><i>LM236, Nika Nanaura.</i></b>

03:32.940 --> 03:34.790
<b>Maybe she'll come for revenge.</b>

03:34.790 --> 03:37.370
<b>Should you be sleeping
with one eye open?</b>

03:37.370 --> 03:41.200
<b>Thinking of you underdogs biting
at each other... It makes me laugh.</b>

03:41.200 --> 03:43.300
<b>Damn right, we're underdogs!</b>

03:43.300 --> 03:46.450
<b>People like you at the top
of the heap would never understand!</b>

03:46.450 --> 03:50.090
<b>I couldn't allow Earth House's
position to get any worse.</b>

03:50.090 --> 03:51.250
<b>As the head of the House, I--</b>

03:51.250 --> 03:54.120
<b>You didn't want to get
mixed up in any trouble.</b>

03:54.980 --> 03:58.140
<b>You realize that you gave up
trying to hear her out.</b>

03:58.140 --> 04:00.460
<b>That's why you can't
confess to those around you.</b>

04:00.770 --> 04:01.650
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

04:04.240 --> 04:05.560
<b>You're right.</b>

04:05.560 --> 04:08.830
<b>I gave up on talking to Nika.</b>

04:08.830 --> 04:10.600
<b>I failed as House leader.</b>

04:11.080 --> 04:14.940
<b>But even so, at that moment,
I really, truly thought</b>

04:14.940 --> 04:17.200
<b>it was the best way to protect every--</b>

04:17.590 --> 04:19.650
<b>Just say that, then.</b>

04:19.650 --> 04:24.500
<b>It's annoying to see
an underdog being so stubborn.</b>

04:29.760 --> 04:33.040
<b>Episode 19</b>

04:33.600 --> 04:38.310
<b>Quinharbor</b>

04:33.860 --> 04:36.590
<b><i>To all passengers from
outside the Earth Sphere...</i></b>

04:36.590 --> 04:38.840
<b><i>As per the Earth Sphere
Biological Protection Act,</i></b>

04:38.840 --> 04:42.680
<b><i>please proceed to the section
for a bio-security check.</i></b>

04:44.590 --> 04:47.640
<b><i>If you are carrying anything
on the biological protection list,</i></b>

04:47.640 --> 04:51.180
<b><i>please notify the relevant staff.</i></b>

04:58.800 --> 05:02.030
<b>Why are our mobile suits escorting us?</b>

05:02.390 --> 05:04.570
<b>I told you I'm seeking
a peaceful solution!</b>

05:04.570 --> 05:09.280
<b>You seriously think those people
will cooperate so reasonably?</b>

05:10.430 --> 05:11.990
<b><i>Sorry to keep you waiting.</i></b>

05:16.270 --> 05:21.470
<b>Even without weapons, it looks
daunting enough to quiet them down.</b>

05:22.450 --> 05:26.680
<b>I'm told that Miorine Rembran
is about to begin negotiations.</b>

05:26.680 --> 05:29.440
<b>If they crush the Earthians
with that Gundam,</b>

05:29.440 --> 05:32.730
<b>more people might end up
supporting Miorine.</b>

05:32.730 --> 05:34.060
<b>That won't happen.</b>

05:34.540 --> 05:36.670
<b>Miorine herself would never allow it.</b>

05:37.630 --> 05:38.690
<b>What's this about?</b>

05:38.690 --> 05:41.530
<b>I wanted to have
a little girls' night out.</b>

05:41.530 --> 05:43.950
<b>I'm just an engineer.</b>

05:43.950 --> 05:48.020
<b>I don't have any information your
League officials would want.</b>

05:48.680 --> 05:54.370
<b>At present, the high council is planning
to forcibly suppress the Benerit Group.</b>

05:54.370 --> 05:57.000
<b>If worse comes to worst,
there could be a clash.</b>

05:57.900 --> 06:03.090
<b>Nevertheless, we'd still like to find
a way for both sides to work together.</b>

06:03.990 --> 06:06.140
<b>If the Group loses its position,</b>

06:06.140 --> 06:09.090
<b>you'll be scapegoated
for breaking the Cathedra Agreement...</b>

06:09.950 --> 06:11.730
<b>Ms. Winston.</b>

06:11.730 --> 06:14.760
<b>You have to think about yourself.</b>

06:14.760 --> 06:16.020
<b>So, please...</b>

06:16.020 --> 06:19.270
<b>Tell me what you know.</b>

06:20.000 --> 06:21.990
<b>This has nothing to do with me.</b>

06:25.590 --> 06:27.030
<b>A girls' night out...</b>

06:27.470 --> 06:29.600
<b>I really did want one.</b>

06:30.060 --> 06:31.800
<b>Spacians go home!</b>

06:31.800 --> 06:33.440
<b>You plan to rip us off even more?!</b>

06:33.440 --> 06:34.840
<b>Release our comrades!</b>

06:34.840 --> 06:36.950
<b>We want an end to your monopoly on Permet!</b>

06:36.110 --> 06:38.880
<b>Hey! Who told them we'd be here?</b>

06:38.880 --> 06:39.920
<b>How should I know?</b>

06:39.920 --> 06:42.760
<b>Madam President, we should regroup.</b>

06:42.760 --> 06:44.630
<b>None of them are armed.</b>

06:45.040 --> 06:47.920
<b>They just want us to hear their voices.</b>

06:56.460 --> 06:58.860
<b>Hey, Spacian! Give me something.</b>

06:59.250 --> 07:01.100
<b>Whoa, kid! Back off!</b>

07:01.100 --> 07:03.690
<b>What was that for? I didn't do anything!</b>

07:05.230 --> 07:07.410
<b>Only authorized personnel...</b>

07:06.340 --> 07:07.410
<b>Young Mr. President...</b>

07:07.410 --> 07:08.580
<b>Please don't stand in place.</b>

07:07.940 --> 07:10.150
<b>Where does it say that, huh?</b>

07:10.160 --> 07:14.460
<b>Miorine... can you negotiate on your own?</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:16.880
<b>What are you talking about?
Of course I can.</b>

07:16.880 --> 07:20.090
<b>I have somewhere to be.
I leave her to you.</b>

07:20.090 --> 07:21.170
<b>What?!</b>

07:21.170 --> 07:23.880
<b>Young Mr. President! Damn it...</b>

07:23.880 --> 07:25.750
<b>Don't let Madam President
out of your sight!</b>

07:26.900 --> 07:28.050
<b>Madam...</b>

07:29.070 --> 07:30.030
<b>Right...</b>

07:35.780 --> 07:37.840
<b>Greetings, everyone.</b>

07:38.310 --> 07:40.020
<b>I'm Miorine Rembran.</b>

07:40.520 --> 07:44.270
<b>My hope today is that
we can speak on equal terms.</b>

07:45.050 --> 07:46.780
<b>Equal, eh?</b>

07:46.780 --> 07:48.030
<b>Follow me.</b>

07:52.760 --> 07:57.540
<b>The Benerit Group intends to
build a new development facility</b>

07:57.540 --> 08:00.500
<b>near the reconstruction district
in the southeast of Quinharbor.</b>

08:00.500 --> 08:05.420
<b>This could produce a maximum
30% rise in local employment--</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:07.540
<b>1,529 people.</b>

08:08.280 --> 08:12.110
<b>That many Earthians are missing or dead
after the Plant Quetta Incident,</b>

08:12.110 --> 08:14.850
<b>thanks to your search
for the perpetrators.</b>

08:15.450 --> 08:19.360
<b>You arrested people without
reason and detained them...</b>

08:19.360 --> 08:22.110
<b>Some of them were tortured, as well.</b>

08:22.110 --> 08:24.280
<b>We never gave any orders to--</b>

08:24.280 --> 08:25.940
<b>You merely weren't informed.</b>

08:26.630 --> 08:28.780
<b>Your monopolization of Permet...</b>

08:28.780 --> 08:32.370
<b>The proxy wars you force onto us
through war partitioning...</b>

08:32.370 --> 08:34.870
<b>Those are already unbearable.</b>

08:34.870 --> 08:38.960
<b>But if you make us suffer further
by going outside the law,</b>

08:38.960 --> 08:41.250
<b>we will do the same.</b>

08:41.730 --> 08:45.350
<b>All Spacians must leave Earth.</b>

08:46.070 --> 08:48.890
<b>That is our demand.</b>

08:52.170 --> 08:53.980
<b>What's a Gundam doing here?!</b>

08:53.980 --> 08:55.510
<b>I don't know the details, either.</b>

08:55.840 --> 08:59.030
<b>It's some kind of joint venture
with GUND-ARM, Inc.</b>

08:59.030 --> 09:00.510
<b>With Miorine?</b>

09:01.130 --> 09:02.720
<b>Die, die, die, die...</b>

09:02.720 --> 09:04.730
<b>Die, die, die, die...</b>

09:04.730 --> 09:07.100
<b>Die, die, die, die...</b>

09:16.950 --> 09:18.800
<b>Let's take a peek.</b>

09:19.580 --> 09:21.090
<b>My, my...</b>

09:26.210 --> 09:27.400
<b>Well...</b>

09:28.000 --> 09:29.040
<b>Don't touch that!</b>

09:30.430 --> 09:31.290
<b>Give it back!</b>

09:31.290 --> 09:32.610
<b>Whoa, hey!</b>

09:35.090 --> 09:38.010
<b>I'll kill them all! Spacians... and you!</b>

09:38.010 --> 09:40.680
<b>I want you... everyone to die!</b>

09:40.680 --> 09:42.160
<b>Die! Die!</b>

09:42.160 --> 09:45.440
<b>Die, die! Die, die! Die, die!</b>

09:45.440 --> 09:48.100
<b>Die, die, die!
Die, die...</b>

09:48.100 --> 09:49.470
<b>Die...</b>

09:52.480 --> 09:53.780
<b>Sophie...</b>

09:54.480 --> 09:56.710
<b>Why did you die on me?</b>

09:56.710 --> 09:57.950
<b>Wait...</b>

09:58.940 --> 10:01.360
<b>Don't leave me here!</b>

10:01.360 --> 10:02.870
<b>I don't want to be alone!</b>

10:04.580 --> 10:06.120
<b>I'm afraid...</b>

10:06.910 --> 10:08.560
<b>to die.</b>

10:10.290 --> 10:13.240
<b>What the heck just happened?</b>

10:13.240 --> 10:15.340
<b>You'll never understand.</b>

10:16.000 --> 10:17.570
<b>Never...</b>

10:18.590 --> 10:26.640
<b><i>GUND-ARM, GUND-ARM
A ray of hope</i></b>

10:23.700 --> 10:24.930
<b>Madam President...</b>

10:24.930 --> 10:26.560
<b>It's time to resume.</b>

10:27.100 --> 10:28.020
<b>Right...</b>

10:29.100 --> 10:30.120
<b>Let's go.</b>

10:31.020 --> 10:32.290
<b>Prosthetic limbs?</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:35.650
<b>This is medical equipment
handled by the company I'm running.</b>

10:35.990 --> 10:40.860
<b>It was designed and developed by Earthian
students at the Asticassia School.</b>

10:40.860 --> 10:45.140
<b>Now you weapons merchants
want to sell us medical products, too?</b>

10:45.140 --> 10:48.620
<b>Just now, you demanded
that all Spacians leave Earth.</b>

10:48.620 --> 10:49.890
<b>Yes...</b>

10:49.890 --> 10:52.780
<b>Then that means the Earthians
must also leave space.</b>

10:52.780 --> 10:53.870
<b>I suppose it does.</b>

10:53.870 --> 10:56.250
<b>That's a demand I flatly reject.</b>

10:56.270 --> 10:57.520
<b>What?</b>

10:57.520 --> 11:00.530
<b>They're my valuable partners.</b>

11:00.530 --> 11:02.890
<b>I can't lose them in such a separation.</b>

11:03.380 --> 11:07.060
<b>I don't claim to understand
how enraged you Earthians are.</b>

11:07.490 --> 11:10.020
<b>Or the economic obstacles you face.</b>

11:10.020 --> 11:13.560
<b>But even so, I seek dialogue.</b>

11:14.310 --> 11:16.040
<b>Please give me a chance!</b>

11:17.140 --> 11:21.280
<b>How can we trust you
when you don't have the final say?</b>

11:21.280 --> 11:25.050
<b>Would you trust me
if I became the Group's president?</b>

11:25.050 --> 11:26.700
<b>Is that your intention?</b>

11:26.700 --> 11:30.410
<b>I now understand
that it's what I really need.</b>

11:33.200 --> 11:35.380
<b>We can't engage in negotiations with you.</b>

11:39.120 --> 11:40.310
<b>Ten days...</b>

11:41.210 --> 11:43.900
<b>Until the results of
your presidential election are clear,</b>

11:43.900 --> 11:46.870
<b>we'll suspend all protest activities.</b>

11:47.430 --> 11:48.700
<b>Are you sure?</b>

11:48.700 --> 11:51.370
<b>Leave the deal-making to the politicians.</b>

11:51.370 --> 11:52.270
<b>Besides...</b>

11:52.800 --> 11:55.400
<b>if we're going to talk,
I'd rather talk about that.</b>

11:56.270 --> 11:58.090
<b>I'm a doctor, after all.</b>

11:58.900 --> 12:00.840
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

12:31.560 --> 12:32.600
<b>Hey!</b>

12:32.600 --> 12:34.390
<b>Suletta came!</b>

12:32.600 --> 12:34.390
<b>W-wait...</b>

12:34.390 --> 12:37.480
<b>I'm not... ready yet!</b>

12:37.830 --> 12:40.670
<b>Do you mind sitting here, Ms. Suletta?</b>

12:40.670 --> 12:42.840
<b>And will you share that ham?</b>

12:43.310 --> 12:44.450
<b>S-Sure...</b>

12:44.450 --> 12:47.220
<b>Breakfast is soup made from Tiko's milk...</b>

12:47.220 --> 12:51.360
<b>We've had to start using
the stuff in the freezer.</b>

12:51.360 --> 12:53.580
<b>You forgot to flip the switch, didn't you?</b>

12:53.580 --> 12:56.690
<b>Which means it's a more
luxurious breakfast than usual.</b>

12:56.690 --> 12:59.750
<b>In that case, we wanted to eat
somewhere a bit brighter.</b>

12:59.750 --> 13:00.780
<b>Here.</b>

13:16.050 --> 13:17.620
<b>How is it?</b>

13:18.100 --> 13:19.690
<b>Yes...</b>

13:21.560 --> 13:23.030
<b>It's delicious!</b>

13:26.270 --> 13:28.320
<b>Okay! Let's dig in!</b>

13:29.530 --> 13:31.190
<b>I'm so hungry, baby!</b>

13:33.460 --> 13:34.580
<b>Can you pass that?</b>

13:36.160 --> 13:37.730
<b>Martin?</b>

13:39.910 --> 13:41.210
<b>Say that again, huh?!</b>

13:41.560 --> 13:43.880
<b>So the management company was right?!</b>

13:42.030 --> 13:43.880
<b>Chuchu, calm down.</b>

13:44.200 --> 13:48.040
<b>It's true. Nika was cooperating
with that terrorist group.</b>

13:48.460 --> 13:52.040
<b>That's why I reported her
to the management company.</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:55.200
<b>Ms. Nika...</b>

13:55.810 --> 14:00.920
<b>Ms. Nika was trying
to stop Ms. Sophie and Ms. Norea.</b>

14:00.920 --> 14:03.550
<b>She wasn't trying to destroy the school.</b>

14:03.550 --> 14:05.230
<b>Maybe so!</b>

14:05.980 --> 14:07.740
<b>But she lied to us.</b>

14:08.480 --> 14:10.660
<b>How can I forgive her?</b>

14:14.320 --> 14:16.660
<b>Only Nika can tell us
why she was doing that.</b>

14:16.660 --> 14:17.850
<b>Till...</b>

14:17.850 --> 14:22.500
<b>I failed to notice
that you were struggling, Martin.</b>

14:22.500 --> 14:25.690
<b>However... Clean the stables.</b>

14:25.690 --> 14:27.760
<b>Enough that the animals feel better.</b>

14:29.040 --> 14:30.890
<b>Forgive me, Till.</b>

14:31.670 --> 14:33.220
<b>I...</b>

14:33.220 --> 14:35.830
<b>I'd have done
the same as you, Martin.</b>

14:35.830 --> 14:37.600
<b>Wait, she's our friend, isn't she?</b>

14:38.100 --> 14:41.290
<b>Even if you know it's not the best way,</b>

14:41.290 --> 14:45.420
<b>there are times when there's only
one thing you can do, right?</b>

14:47.150 --> 14:49.200
<b>I heard about Seethia.</b>

14:49.860 --> 14:52.010
<b>You made a grave, too?</b>

14:52.450 --> 14:54.760
<b>It was the only thing I could do for her.</b>

14:54.760 --> 14:56.180
<b>Hey, kid!</b>

14:56.180 --> 14:58.680
<b>Are any of your Fold buddies still here?</b>

14:58.680 --> 14:59.540
<b>No.</b>

14:59.540 --> 15:02.560
<b>And my name's not "kid,"
it's Sedo Wanchek.</b>

15:02.560 --> 15:06.060
<b>I'm an official refugee designated
by the special reconstruction plan.</b>

15:06.420 --> 15:07.770
<b>Never mind.</b>

15:07.770 --> 15:08.760
<b>Let's go back.</b>

15:08.760 --> 15:11.030
<b>Hey, w-wait!</b>

15:11.030 --> 15:14.720
<b>Benerit has a school
that takes in Earthians like me, right?</b>

15:14.720 --> 15:15.740
<b>School?</b>

15:15.740 --> 15:16.750
<b>Young Mr. President, we--</b>

15:16.060 --> 15:17.660
<b>Will you let me in?</b>

15:19.550 --> 15:22.040
<b>He probably means the Academy.</b>

15:22.040 --> 15:25.290
<b>Grassley's child-rearing program?</b>

15:25.290 --> 15:27.820
<b>That place is run by meritocracy.</b>

15:27.820 --> 15:31.210
<b>They even take in orphans who lost
their families to war partitioning</b>

15:31.210 --> 15:33.200
<b>and reeducate them.</b>

15:33.690 --> 15:38.170
<b>Shaddiq Zenelli and their other
five pilots all came from there.</b>

15:38.170 --> 15:40.520
<b>So you can do it, right?</b>

15:40.520 --> 15:43.010
<b>I don't belong to Grassley.</b>

15:43.010 --> 15:44.810
<b>Ask one of the Academy graduates.</b>

15:44.810 --> 15:46.230
<b>Come on!</b>

15:46.230 --> 15:48.960
<b>I just want to be like the Prince!</b>

15:49.270 --> 15:50.360
<b>The Prince?</b>

15:50.360 --> 15:52.780
<b>He's an awesome guy who graduated from</b>

15:52.780 --> 15:55.640
<b>whatever that place is,
and now aids us Earthians.</b>

15:56.130 --> 15:59.740
<b>Instead of piloting mobile suits
like Sophie or Norea,</b>

15:59.740 --> 16:01.020
<b>I'm more interested in--</b>

16:01.690 --> 16:02.480
<b>Mr. Kenanji!</b>

16:02.480 --> 16:03.290
<b>You...</b>

16:03.290 --> 16:05.370
<b>Who told you about all that?</b>

16:05.370 --> 16:07.790
<b>Who...? The adults, of course.</b>

16:07.790 --> 16:09.030
<b>Everyone knows about it!</b>

16:09.030 --> 16:10.340
<b>Mr. Kenanji, what are--</b>

16:10.340 --> 16:12.860
<b>That's Shaddiq Zenelli's nickname.</b>

16:13.400 --> 16:14.720
<b>Jeru Ogul...</b>

16:14.720 --> 16:17.390
<b>That was his name before he was adopted.</b>

16:17.390 --> 16:19.390
<b>Since he was a remarkable child,</b>

16:19.390 --> 16:23.120
<b>and because of that name, everyone
at the Academy called him "Prince."</b>

16:23.120 --> 16:26.420
<b>You said it yourself.
Everyone knows about it, right?</b>

16:26.420 --> 16:29.810
<b>And yet not one person
has ever given us such a report.</b>

16:29.810 --> 16:34.070
<b>No one except you, an Earthian
who lived with the Dawn of Fold.</b>

16:39.130 --> 16:40.430
<b>Excuse me...</b>

16:41.000 --> 16:42.990
<b>Guel, where are--</b>

16:42.990 --> 16:44.060
<b><i>It's Shaddiq!</i></b>

16:44.060 --> 16:46.830
<b>The Open Campus, and Plant Quetta...</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:48.520
<b>They're all farces that he staged!</b>

16:48.910 --> 16:50.650
<b>Arrest him and grill him right now!</b>

16:50.650 --> 16:52.610
<b>Calm down. Do you have evidence?</b>

16:53.770 --> 16:55.780
<b><i>Without it, he'll just shrug it off.</i></b>

16:57.030 --> 16:59.280
<b>Guel, go back to Asticassia.</b>

16:59.280 --> 17:00.720
<b>To the school?</b>

17:00.720 --> 17:03.250
<b><i>If you can find President Sarius,
that'll be your evidence.</i></b>

17:03.740 --> 17:08.500
<b><i>Shaddiq must be keeping him close by,
in the place he feels is safest.</i></b>

17:08.500 --> 17:10.500
<b>Grassley House!</b>

17:11.790 --> 17:13.510
<b><i>Oh, going home already?</i></b>

17:13.510 --> 17:16.360
<b>There's been a sudden change of plans.</b>

17:16.360 --> 17:18.040
<b>We'll be taking our leave.</b>

17:18.040 --> 17:19.430
<b><i>Understood.</i></b>

17:19.430 --> 17:20.260
<b>Goodbye.</b>

17:22.300 --> 17:23.600
<b>Let us begin...</b>

17:23.600 --> 17:24.720
<b>Eri...</b>

17:37.660 --> 17:38.410
<b>Huh?</b>

17:39.940 --> 17:41.410
<b><i>Hey, wait a minute!</i></b>

17:46.620 --> 17:48.890
<b><i>What are you doing?
I haven't issued any orders!</i></b>

17:48.890 --> 17:51.090
<b><i>You're wrong! It's not me!</i></b>

17:51.090 --> 17:53.270
<b>Attention, garrison command.</b>

17:53.270 --> 17:55.170
<b>We've been attacked by the demonstrators.</b>

17:55.170 --> 17:57.690
<b><i>As we're unarmed, we are evacuating.</i></b>

17:57.690 --> 17:59.260
<b>Wait! You can't leave your post--</b>

18:04.010 --> 18:07.440
<b>President Miorine is
on Earth right now, isn't she?</b>

18:07.890 --> 18:09.790
<b>Why Quinharbor?</b>

18:09.790 --> 18:11.020
<b>Why...?</b>

18:11.020 --> 18:15.460
<b>Did those two really go
for the purpose of negotiations?</b>

18:42.550 --> 18:45.030
<b>Code name: Sophie Pulone.</b>

18:45.030 --> 18:47.730
<b>Machine: Lfrith Ur.</b>

18:48.430 --> 18:51.080
<b>Code name: Norea Du Noc.</b>

18:51.080 --> 18:53.420
<b>Machine: Lfrith Thorn.</b>

18:53.420 --> 18:54.520
<b>Affiliation...</b>

18:55.820 --> 18:57.400
<b>Ochs Earth?!</b>

18:57.400 --> 19:02.260
<b>The two Gundams that attacked
Plant Quetta and Benerit's school...</b>

19:02.260 --> 19:03.590
<b>that's where they came from.</b>

19:03.590 --> 19:05.260
<b>H-Hold on...</b>

19:05.260 --> 19:08.220
<b>Ochs Earth was... 21 years ago...</b>

19:08.220 --> 19:09.530
<b>I told you, didn't I?</b>

19:09.530 --> 19:12.850
<b>The higher-ups are trying to
forcibly suppress the Group.</b>

19:12.850 --> 19:13.670
<b>You don't mean...</b>

19:14.160 --> 19:19.320
<b>The ones who support the once-defunct
Ochs Earth as a covert organization...</b>

19:19.320 --> 19:21.130
<b>are the Assembly League's
high council.</b>

19:22.000 --> 19:23.700
<b>Although I don't have proof.</b>

19:29.850 --> 19:33.330
<b>The heinous sinners who trampled
on GUND's ideals...</b>

19:33.330 --> 19:36.860
<b>Now you're trying to interfere with
Eri's future?</b>

19:36.860 --> 19:39.050
<b>I can't allow that, can I?</b>

19:42.490 --> 19:43.620
<b>An attack?!</b>

19:43.620 --> 19:46.410
<b>They've done it. It's the Spacians!</b>

19:49.450 --> 19:52.560
<b>I won't deny that I tried to use you,</b>

19:52.560 --> 19:55.840
<b>but it's also true
that I want to avoid armed conflict.</b>

19:55.840 --> 19:57.210
<b>Please...</b>

19:58.390 --> 20:00.420
<b>Lend us your support.</b>

20:00.420 --> 20:02.280
<b><i>All units, you are not
authorized to attack.</i></b>

20:02.280 --> 20:04.260
<b><i>I repeat. You are not
authorized to attack.</i></b>

20:09.520 --> 20:11.600
<b>What the hell is happening...?</b>

20:11.600 --> 20:13.440
<b>Did you trick us?</b>

20:13.440 --> 20:16.120
<b>No! We aren't the ones who...</b>

20:16.430 --> 20:18.040
<b>How unfortunate.</b>

20:18.040 --> 20:18.980
<b>We're leaving.</b>

20:18.980 --> 20:21.300
<b>Wait, please! Hear me out!</b>

20:21.300 --> 20:22.360
<b>This way, Madam President.</b>

20:24.860 --> 20:26.780
<b>Plant Quetta?</b>

20:26.780 --> 20:28.760
<b>You'll find it there.</b>

20:28.760 --> 20:33.680
<b>A component of Quiet Zero,
the project that is her obsession.</b>

20:33.680 --> 20:35.500
<b>Quiet Zero?</b>

20:36.200 --> 20:38.150
<b>In any case, let's hurry to the plant!</b>

20:47.630 --> 20:50.780
<b>It was a cinch for them
to win you over, wasn't it...</b>

20:50.780 --> 20:52.230
<b>Dr. Winston?</b>

20:53.810 --> 20:54.330
<b>Feng!</b>

20:54.330 --> 20:56.410
<b>Please! Take her!</b>

20:56.410 --> 20:57.730
<b>Move!</b>

21:12.410 --> 21:15.640
<b><i>Fighting is currently escalating
in the eastern part of the city,</i></b>

21:15.640 --> 21:17.880
<b><i>as Benerit Group mobile suits</i></b>

21:16.290 --> 21:17.880
<b>Spacians...</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:20.130
<b><i>open fire on housing complexes
where anti-Spacian activists</i></b>

21:20.130 --> 21:21.960
<b><i>have barricaded themselves.</i></b>

21:22.500 --> 21:24.340
<b>It turned out just like I said.</b>

21:24.690 --> 21:26.320
<b>So what happens now?</b>

21:28.550 --> 21:32.370
<b>I called for a ship, as well as
mobile suits and Sabina's team.</b>

21:32.370 --> 21:35.180
<b>Prospera Mercury was onto us, after all.</b>

21:36.350 --> 21:38.980
<b>Guel... You've defiled her.</b>

21:38.980 --> 21:41.610
<b><i>In response to
the Benerit Group's attack...</i></b>

21:40.320 --> 21:41.610
<b>Miorine...</b>

21:41.610 --> 21:43.190
<b><i>...anti-Spacian groups...</i></b>

21:41.610 --> 21:43.190
<b>It can't be.</b>

21:43.190 --> 21:45.380
<b>What the hell is Miorine doing?!</b>

21:45.380 --> 21:48.300
<b><i>The leader of
the Earth Independence Movement...</i></b>

21:48.300 --> 21:49.120
<b><i>That's why...</i></b>

21:49.780 --> 21:52.680
<b><i>you can't cling to me anymore...</i></b>

21:52.680 --> 21:55.830
<b><i>Not to me, or to Mom.</i></b>

21:58.370 --> 22:00.600
<b>I understand now.</b>

22:00.600 --> 22:01.940
<b>Suletta?</b>

22:01.940 --> 22:04.700
<b>Aerial was just like you, Mr. Martin.</b>

22:04.700 --> 22:05.210
<b>Huh?</b>

22:06.290 --> 22:09.680
<b>She knew that this is what Mom would do.</b>

22:10.550 --> 22:12.620
<b>Even if it wasn't the best way,</b>

22:14.300 --> 22:16.410
<b>Aerial did the only thing she could.</b>

22:17.390 --> 22:21.480
<b>I... didn't understand a thing.</b>

22:24.230 --> 22:26.240
<b>It's all my fault.</b>

22:27.480 --> 22:29.050
<b>I...</b>

22:29.770 --> 22:31.470
<b>did this.</b>

23:44.020 --> 23:45.420
<b><i>Next time,</i></b>

23:44.670 --> 23:48.990
<b>Episode 20</b>

23:45.770 --> 23:47.680
<b><i>"The End of Hope."</i></b>

23:48.990 --> 23:52.250
<b>Illustration: KEIGO INOUE</b>
